            "sid": "JER 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laiti kichwa changu kingekuwa maji, na macho yangu kuwa chemchemi ya machozi, ili nipate kulia mchana na usiku kwa ajili yao waliouawa wa binti ya watu wangu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laiti ningekuwa na mahali pa kukaa jangwani, kibanda cha wasafiri; nipate kuwaacha watu wangu, na kuondoka kwao! Maana wao ni wazinzi, wote pia, mkutano wa watu wenye hiana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
